---

---

<section class="bg-[#ECECEE] border-b border-slate-300">
  <!-- Panoramic Image -->
  <div
    class="relative w-full aspect-video sm:aspect-[21/9] lg:h-[580px] overflow-hidden bg-slate-300"
  >
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582719478250-c89cae4dc85b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85"
      alt="Design Build Process Bali Villa"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Process -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14 sm:mb-16">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight mb-3"
      >
        The Design-Build Process
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
        We aim to simplify the build process, keeping you updated every step of
        the way. We're in it together, from start to finish.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            1
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Consultation
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          <a
            href="/portfolio"
            class="underline font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-[#F26522] transition-colors"
          >
            View our work online
          </a>
          {" "}then{" "}
          <a
            href="#kontak"
            class="underline font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-[#F26522] transition-colors"
          >
            get in touch
          </a>
          {" "}for a free consultation. Let's set the goals and vision for your
          project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            2
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Proposal
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Read through our proposal. Discuss it. Make amendments. Agree it. View
          one of our completed projects. Let's get going.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            3
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Planning
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          We draw up the initial plans including the overall strategy and
          execution. We'll talk this through with you and iron out any details.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            4
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Project Kick-off
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Once the plans are approved and permits in place, we break ground.
          Materials are sourced, site logistics set up, and construction begins.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 5 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            5
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Development
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          We manage every stage with strict quality audits, bi-weekly progress
          reporting, and milestone walk-throughs to ensure perfection.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 6 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#F4F4F6] border border-slate-300 p-8 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-slate-950 font-sans"
          >
            6
          </span>

          <h3
            class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Completion
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Final detailing, MEP testing, snagging resolution, and official
          handover of your completed luxury property with full warranty.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
